# BuildKit reads this next to deploy/worker/Dockerfile (Dockerfile-specific ignore file). Build context = the repo root.
# Whitelist (D-MONOREPO-LAYOUT 2026-10-07): only deploy/common/{s2s_token.py,session.py,data/records_v4.json},
# deploy/worker/ (minus the dirs below) and the shared runtime packages are sent. research/, docs/, deploy/{client,space,
# ops,tests}/ and packages/hinglish_text/ (data-build only) never enter the context.
*
!deploy/common/s2s_token.py
!deploy/common/session.py
!deploy/common/data/records_v4.json
!deploy/worker/
deploy/worker/local/
deploy/worker/tests/
deploy/worker/tools/
deploy/worker/build/
!packages/needle_router/
!packages/personaplex_lora/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venvs/
**/build/
**/*.egg-info/
